[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0226","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0239","title":"Hanterm Hanterm 3.3 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Hanterm 3.3.1 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长字符串的特定命令参数（如 -fn、-hfb 或 -hfn 参数）触发漏洞。漏洞利用引发堆内存溢出，导致程序控制流被篡改，攻击者得以劫持控制权并执行任意代码。受影响用户包括所有使用汉化终端模拟器的 Windows 用户，攻击条件为本地执行触发，攻击者需精心构造超出程序缓冲区长度的输入。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台下的 Hanterm 终端模拟器，攻击者可利用本地权限获得系统完全控制权，破坏系统完整性、机密性和可用性。攻击者仅需向程序提交经过精心构造的长字符串参数即可触发漏洞，无需身份验证，环境复杂度较低，漏洞利用相对直接。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0239"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 hanterm 至 3.3.2 或更高版本（如已停止维护，建议迁移至 rxvt-unicode、xterm 或 konsole 等现代终端模拟器）；若暂时无法升级，请限制本地用户对 hanterm 二进制文件的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/bin/hanterm 并限制所属组），或通过 SELinux/AppArmor 策略限制 hanterm 仅以受限上下文运行，禁止本地非特权用户传递超长 -fn/-hfb/-hfn 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101310874106455&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/255168","http://securitytracker.com/id?1001950","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-112","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8109.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4050","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0239","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0239.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0239.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0239.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0225","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0236","title":"Lucent 8.x - VitalNet 密码身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Lucent VitalSuite 8.0 至 8.2 版本（包括 VitalNet、VitalEvent 及 VitalHelp/VitalAnalysis 组件）存在密码身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何凭据，即可通过直接向目标服务器发送特制 HTTP 请求访问 VsSetCookie.exe 程序，该程序会返回指定用户的合法身份认证 cookie。攻击者获取该 cookie 后即可直接以目标用户身份登录系统，完全绕过密码验证机制，进而可能导致未授权访问敏感网络管理数据或执行管理操作。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击复杂度低，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0236"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Lucent VitalSuite 8.3 或更高版本（若厂商已发布修复版本），或通过 Web 服务器配置禁用/限制对 VsSetCookie.exe 的直接访问。若无法升级，请在防火墙/WAF 层面拦截针对 /VsSetCookie.exe 的非预期 HTTP 请求，并强制要求 VPN/多因子认证访问管理界面。同时审计现有会话 Cookie，强制所有管理员重置密码并失效现有会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101294507827698&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7936.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3784","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21203","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0236","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0236.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0236.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0236.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0208","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0193","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Content-Disposition处理不当任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01和6.0版本存在Content-Disposition处理漏洞。该漏洞源于浏览器对Content-Disposition和Content-Type HTTP头字段的解析不当，当攻击者构造包含畸形头字段的恶意文件时，浏览器会将该文件传递给操作系统进行处理而非弹出错误提示，从而导致任意代码执行。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或下载特制文件来执行任意代码，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响Internet Explorer 5.01和6.0版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级为高危。Microsoft已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级IE版本或应用安全更新以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0193"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:58Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-027 对应的安全补丁，或升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 SP1 以上版本。对于无法立即升级的环境，在 Internet 区域安全级别中禁用文件下载功能，或通过组策略禁用 Content-Disposition 头处理中的自动执行逻辑。建议最终迁移至受支持的现代浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/b