Internet Explorer CSS 本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01、5.5 及 6.0 版本中存在本地信息泄露漏洞（MS02-023）。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 CSS 脚本的网页，利用 stylesheet 对象的 cssText 属性读取目标系统上包含 \"{\" 字符的任意文件内容。攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发该漏洞，导致敏感信息泄露。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS02-023 中发布相关补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0191"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:58Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-023 提供的补丁，升级 Internet Explorer 至最新版本。对于无法立即打补丁的环境，可禁用 Active Scripting 或使用组策略限制样式表对象的 cssText 属性访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101778302030981&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8740.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4411","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-023","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21361","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0191.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0191.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0191.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0191.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0191","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0191.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0191.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0191.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0191.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6627fbe158e9fca31f355d5243a197fbe6b8a60c/2002/CVE-2002-0191.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0204.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0203","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0189","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 同源策略绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 及 6.0 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制 URL 利用本地 HTML 资源文件，绕过同源策略（Same Origin Policy）在本地计算机区域（Local Computer zone）执行恶意脚本。该漏洞源于浏览器对本地 HTML 资源文件的权限检查不充分，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或权限提升。Microsoft 已在 MS02-047 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0189"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 于 2002 年 8 月发布的 Internet Explorer 累积安全更新 Q323759（对应公告 MS02-047）。该补丁修复了 IE 5.01/5.5/6.0 中本地 HTML 资源的跨站脚本绕过漏洞。如无法安装补丁，可将不受信任的网站加入受限站点区域，并启用 Outlook 2002 SP1 的\"以纯文本阅读\"功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-023","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A19","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21750","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0189","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6627fbe158e9fca31f355d5243a197fbe6b8a60c/2002/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0189.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0189.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0189.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0203.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0203.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0203.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0182","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0374","title":"pam_ldap PAM LDAP 模块格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"pam_ldap PAM LDAP 模块（版本 144 之前）的日志记录功能中存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在配置文件名称中注入特制的格式化字符串，在调用日志函数时触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 pam_ldap 模块进行 LDAP 认证的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可获取系统控制权或造成拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0374"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:18Z","remediation":"升级 pam_ldap 模块至 144 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:084/141/175/180 更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:075 更新；Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-2002-041.0.txt 补丁。如无法升级，限制对 LDAP 认证服务的配置文件写入权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0053.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103601912505261&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9018.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:075","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-084.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-141.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-175.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-180.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4679","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0374","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5fdf468f2fb873a7503bb1902a9b5f49d74e59db/2002/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0374.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0374.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2002/CVE-2002-0374.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0182.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0181","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0363","title":"Artifex Ghostscript 代码执行漏洞","description":"Ghostscript 6.53 之前版本中存在安全沙箱绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 PostScript 文件，利用 .locksafe 或 .setsafe 操作符重置当前页面设备（pagedevice），从而绕过 Ghostscript 的安全限制机制，实现任意命令执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响所有使用受影响版本 Ghostscript 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0363"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:17Z","remediation":"升级 Ghostscript 至 6.53 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002-083/RHSA-2002-123/RHSA-2003-209 更新；Caldera OpenLinux 用户应用 CSSA-2002-026.0 补丁。如无法升级，限制不可信用户对 Ghostscript 的调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ghostscript.com/pipermail/gs-code-review/2002-February/001900.html","http://www.ghostscript.com/pipermail/gs-code-review/2002-January/001801.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9254.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-083.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-123.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-209.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4937","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0363","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/878a3042444029b151459a1565a690101509a27a/2002/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0363.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0363.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0363.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0162","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0178","title":"GNU sharutils uudecode 任意文件覆盖与代码执行漏洞","description":"sharutils 工具包中的 uudecode 程序在处理解码后的文件名时，未检查该文件名是否为管道文件或符号链接，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的 uuencoded 文件，诱使目标用户解码后触发符号链接指向任意文件，实现文件覆盖或命令执行。该漏洞影响 sharutils 4.2.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要本地访问权限，但无需身份认证，利用复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0178"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:56Z","remediation":"升级 sharutils 至 4.2.1 及以上版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:065 更新，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:052 更新，Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-2002-040.0 更新。如无法升级，避免对不可信 uuencode 文件执行 uudecode 解码操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103599320902432&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4132","http://www.aerasec.de/security/index.html?id=ae-200204-033&lang=en","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9075.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/336083","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-052.php","http://www.osvdb.org/8274","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-065.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-180.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4742","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0178","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0d17d6f83c6018bb718bcfce6a977efcc0a37796/2002/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0178.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0178.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0178.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0157","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0169","title":"Red Hat DocBook Tools 默认样式表任意文件可写漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7.2 版本中 DocBook 工具的默认样式表因启用了不安全的选项，导致存在任意文件可写漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在不可信文档中使用完整路径名作为元素标识符，将文件写入当前目录之外的位置，从而覆盖系统关键文件。该漏洞利用条件为需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议用户修改默认样式表配置或升级到修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0169"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:55Z","remediation":"立即安装 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2002:062 提供的更新版 DocBook 样式表包。对于 Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7.2 系统，运行 `rpm -Uvh docbook-stylesheets-*.rpm` 升级到修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可移除默认样式表中的不安全选项（`-O` 参数），或限制不可信文档的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4095","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8983.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5349","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-062.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4654","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0169","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2002/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0169.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0169.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0169.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0148","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0033","title":"Sun Solaris cachefsd 远程堆溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统的 cachefsd（缓存文件系统守护进程）中的 cfsd_calloc 函数存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标系统发送包含超长目录名和缓存名称的特制请求，触发堆缓冲区溢出，可导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2/7/8/9 等多个版本，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击者利用此漏洞可完全控制受影响系统，实现远程代码执行，造成系统被完全接管。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0033"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:37Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun Alert 44309 提供的对应 Solaris 版本的 cachefsd 补丁。对于 Solaris 2.6/7/8/9，可通过 SunSolve 网站下载并安装补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可在 inetd.conf 中注释 cachefsd 服务行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，或在网络边界防火墙封禁对 cachefsd 端口（默认 100235/TCP）的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0026.html","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert%2F44309","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-11.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8999.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/635811","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4674","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A124","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A31","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21437","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0033.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0033","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0033.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0033.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9p84-w92j-68vw/GHSA-9p84-w92j-68vw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0033.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cachefsd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--67e220f1-2578-4825-baca-b3c1a44c430f.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0591","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1447","title":"Cisco VPN Client for Unix 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco VPN Client for Unix 3.5.1 及更早版本的 vpnclient 程序中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 connect 参数传递超长的配置文件名称，触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得系统的管理权限。该漏洞影响运行 UNIX 平台的 Cisco VPN Client 3.5.2 之前版本，攻击者需预先获得本地访问权限方可利用此漏洞成功执行提权操作，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级较高。Cisco 已在后续版本中修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1447"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco VPN Client for Unix 至 3.5.2 或更高版本。临时缓解措施包括：通过 chmod 或文件系统 ACL 限制本地用户对 /usr/local/bin/vpnclient 的执行权限，删除不必要的连接配置文件，并监控该程序的异常调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/277653","http://sec.angrypacket.com/advisories/0002_AP.vpnclient.txt","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/cisco-unix-vpnclient-buffer-overflow-pub.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9376.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5056","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21568","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1447.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1447.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1447.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1447","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1447.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1447.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1447.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1447.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2002/CVE-2002-1447.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1447.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0591.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0223","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0231","title":"mIRC 昵称缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"mIRC 5.91 及更早版本存在昵称缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向客户端发送超长昵称字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。攻击者只需在 IRC 服务器上设置一个超长昵称，当目标用户连接该服务器或接收包含恶意昵称的消息时即可触发漏洞。该漏洞影响 mIRC 2.x 至 5.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已有公开的利用代码，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0231"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:02Z","remediation":"升级 mIRC 至 6.0 或更高版本（当前最新版为 6.35），该漏洞已在 6.0 中修复。如无法升级，可在服务器设置中限制昵称长度不超过 9 个字符，并避免连接不可信的 IRC 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101286747013955&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/254105","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8083.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4027","http://www.uuuppz.com/research/adv-001-mirc.htm","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21274","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0231.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0231.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0231.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0231","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0231.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0231.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0231.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0231.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0231.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0223.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0221","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0230","title":"Faq-O-Matic fom.cgi 跨站脚本攻击","description":"Faq-O-Matic 2.712 的 fom.cgi 脚本存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，由于对 cmd 参数缺乏输入验证和输出编码，远程未认证攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 诱导用户访问，脚本会被注入错误消息并在受害者浏览器中执行。该漏洞影响 Faq-O-Matic 2.6/2.7 版本，攻击向量为网络远程利用，无需身份认证，CVSS 5.0 中危级别，主要影响用户会话完整性和数据机密性，可导致会话劫持、钓鱼攻击或敏感信息窃取。受影响组件为 fom.cgi 的 cmd 参数处理逻辑，攻击载荷通过错误回显页面反射执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0230"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:02Z","remediation":"建议迁移至活跃维护的 FAQ 系统（如 MediaWiki、DokuWiki 或 BookStack）；若必须继续使用 Faq-O-Matic，需修改 fom.cgi 对 cmd 参数实施严格输入验证（仅允许字母数字）并对输出进行 HTML 实体编码（如使用 HTML::Entities::encode_entities），同时在 Web 服务器配置中添加 Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'self' 响应头作为纵深防御。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-109 升级至 faq-o-matic_2.712-2.woody1 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101285834018701&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101293973111873&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_id=464940&forum_id=6367","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-109","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21263","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0230","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0230.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0230.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0230.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0221.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0221.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0221.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0220","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0227","title":"KICQ 2.0.0b1 畸形ICQ报文拒绝服务漏洞","description":"KICQ 2.0.0b1 版本在处理畸形 ICQ 数据包时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标系统发送特制的畸形 ICQ 消息包，即可触发程序崩溃，导致服务不可用。该漏洞源于对畸形数据包缺乏有效的边界检查和异常处理，攻击者可通过构造特定格式的 ICQ 数据包实现攻击，影响 KICQ 2.0.0b1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0227"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:02Z","remediation":"KICQ 2.0.0b1 已停止维护且不再有安全更新，建议立即卸载 KICQ 并迁移至现代即时通讯客户端（如 Pidgin 或 Kopete）。如暂时无法卸载，可在防火墙层面阻止对 KICQ 监听端口（默认 1030/TCP）的外部入站访问，以降低远程攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101266856410129&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8064.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4018","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21262","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0227","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0227.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0227.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0227.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0219","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0215","title":"Agora.cgi 3.2r至4.0 调试模式完整路径泄露漏洞","description":"Agora.cgi 3.2r 至 4.0 版本在开启调试模式时存在完整路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过请求一个不存在的 .html 文件触发该漏洞，服务器返回的错误信息中会泄露 agora.cgi 脚本在服务器上的完整物理路径。该漏洞可被攻击者利用来收集目标系统的目录结构信息，为进一步攻击（如路径遍历、文件包含等）提供基础。攻击条件简单，仅需目标开启调试模式且网络可达即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0215"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:00Z","remediation":"立即禁用 Agora.cgi 的调试模式（debug mode），将配置文件中 `debug` 参数设为 `0` 或 `off`。如无法修改配置，在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache 的 `<Location>` 或 Nginx 的 `location` 块）限制对 `agora.cgi` 的访问来源 IP。建议升级至已修复此问题的 Agora 4.0 以上版本，或迁移至其他受支持的论坛软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/252761","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8011.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3976","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21249","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0215","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0215.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0215.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0215.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url"